        "exact_text": "Your task is to parse this Three.js file to find the part-level structure of the defined 3D object. Then, you need to find each individual mesh defined directly by primitive functions as well as the part meshes defined by THREE.Group. Finally, please save them to the folder `/root/output/part_meshes` and `/root/output/links`.\n",
